<section class="card dashboard-settings" id="visitor-allowlist"><p class="eyebrow">VISITOR ACCESS · SHARED SETTINGS</p><h2>Allowed visitor emails.</h2><p class="hint">Allow everyone at a domain, or a specific email address. Exact matches only; subdomains and email aliases must be added separately. Changes apply to visitor verification, booking access and visitor email. Existing bookings are retained. Owner login is separate.</p>
<div id="allowlist-lists" class="two-col"></div>
<form id="allowlist-form" hidden><h3 id="allowlist-form-title">Add entry</h3><div class="field-pair"><label>Type<select name="kind"><option value="domain">Domain</option><option value="email">Individual email</option></select></label><label>Value<input name="value" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="off" placeholder="example.com or visitor@example.com" /></label></div><button type="submit" class="button">Save entry</button> <button type="button" class="text-button" id="allowlist-edit-cancel">Cancel edit</button></form>
<p id="allowlist-result" role="status">Loading saved list…</p><button type="button" class="text-button" id="allowlist-reload">Reload list</button><p class="hint">Saved for all owners. Changes are recorded in Activity. A stale edit is rejected for review. An empty list permits no visitors.</p></section>
<script>import '../scripts/visitor-allowlist';</script>
